        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported associated symptoms and history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Appetite described as okay, but food is a bit dry. No history of food bolus requiring ED attendance. No haematemesis, melaena, known iron deficiency anaemia, cough, aspiration, or recurrent chest X-ray issues."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-4",
